#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-9442 expect=violation domain=GV
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when --METHOD is not populated.
#note "GVMETHOD blank -> violation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of GVMETHOD."
#library standard=sendig-genetox version=1-0
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset GV
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col GVSEQ type=Char
col GVTESTCD type=Char
col GVTEST type=Char
col GVMETHOD type=Char
---
S1      | GV     | S1-001  | 1     | MNCELL   | Micronucleated Cells |
---
